      "payload": "tree de9df005373dd10d2f484ee851af03699da9ca5e\nparent e089d4b800c4cc75e3cf944eadb791740642a6e0\nauthor feitianxiang <summer.achelous@gmail.com> 1792572205 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792572205 +0800\n\nfeat(sdk): add MemHub authority migration contracts (#129)\n\n* feat(sdk): expose memory lifecycle status filters\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): persist idempotent write outcomes\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): add explicit exact raw APIs\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): snapshot quiesced local data plane\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): restore quiesced local data plane\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(sdk): report incomplete physical deletes\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs(sdk): record authority migration contracts\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: alvinfei <alvinfei@tencent.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
